HAdo 1.2.0

• Move an item to another list: long-press an item, tap "Move to list" and pick the target list
• Moving keeps the title, description, due date and done status when the target list supports them
• Before you move, the list picker warns when a target list would drop the description, the time, the due date or the done status
• If Home Assistant cannot remove the item from the old list, the item stays in both lists and nothing is lost
